1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 11)

2
00:00:21,079 --> 00:00:22,360
Meng Yuanxiong.

3
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,440
Taiji.

4
00:01:03,072 --> 00:01:04,632
[Zhuo Zhixuan]

5
00:01:11,719 --> 00:01:13,040
I need you to do me a favor.

6
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,439
Why is it her again?

7
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,536
You turned down that offer back then

8
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,920
because she gambled all the money away.

9
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,736
You missed seeing Zhao
Shengge off at the airport

10
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:27,159
because of her gambling, too.

11
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:28,959
Then you got dragged into it and locked up.

12
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,200
And now it's her again.

13
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,840
How can you stay so calm?

14
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,760
She's always dragging you down,

15
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,560
and holding Kexiang back.

16
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,695
Can't you just cut her off?

17
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:39,719
Xuan,

18
00:01:43,319 --> 00:01:45,519
she's the one who saved
me from Xiaolan Mountain.

19
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:48,320
Mom's here. Don't be afraid.

20
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,480
Mom is right here.

21
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,560
So what do we do now?

22
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:55,879
I have a rough idea of what they're up to.

23
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:58,519
I just checked Rongxin's stock price.

24
00:01:58,599 --> 00:01:59,960
It's artificially inflated.

25
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,560
I suspect Taiji is setting a trap

26
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,719
to short Rongxin.

27
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,480
Then who sent you this message?

28
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,560
I don't know.

29
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,000
But I have a plan.

30
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:12,639
I need your help.

31
00:02:14,719 --> 00:02:16,319
Another plan?

32
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,440
Think this through.

33
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,720
Are you sure you want to go
behind Zhao Shengge's back?

34
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:34,080
If he finds out,

35
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,560
he'll kill you.

36
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:39,360
And he'll kill me, too.

37
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,240
Then so be it.

38
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:49,480
Just tell me what to do,

39
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,560
and I'm in.

40
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,680
By the way, Xuan,

41
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:57,360
do you have any new stickers?

42
00:02:58,599 --> 00:02:59,960
Could you send me some more?

43
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:14,959
Hello, sweetheart?

44
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,839
Can you come home tomorrow?

45
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:18,039
It's a family gathering.

46
00:03:18,879 --> 00:03:19,959
Okay.

47
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:20,440
All right.

48
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,520
Bye.

49
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,080
Hello, Young Master.

50
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:36,159
Fourth Young Master.

51
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,280
Look at you, Wan, so impressive.

52
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,400
Driving back in a new car.

53
00:03:41,319 --> 00:03:41,720
Sweetheart,

54
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,800
you're back.

55
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:43,799
How have you been lately?

56
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:44,959
Doing okay?

57
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,039
Look at this.

58
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:51,160
What do you expect me to do?

59
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,976
The other women are
all fighting for his favor.

60
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,519
And you won't help me,

61
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:56,439
so I have to go to him.

62
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:09,280
Sweetheart,

63
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,615
you haven't been back in a long time.

64
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:11,960
Go sit with your father.

65
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:13,600
Go on.

66
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,799
No need.

67
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:16,039
I'm fine standing right here.

68
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:17,520
Wan is practically

69
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,480
the Crown Prince's favorite right now.

70
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,600
How could he have time
to come home for dinner?

71
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,040
Isn't that the truth?

72
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,319
Not at all.

73
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:25,679
I don't know Mr. Zhao that well.

74
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:28,040
It's only for Zhuo Zhixuan's sake.

75
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,999
Wan,

76
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:29,879
if you put it that way,

77
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:31,399
you're being way too modest.

78
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,400
I heard you went to Ting Island, right?

79
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,439
You really proved yourself protecting him.

80
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:38,160
I went with a whole group of people.

81
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,040
It's true.

82
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,999
Last time Wan went with
me to the Mazu Temple,

83
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:44,199
Mr. Zhao even went out
of his way to say hello.

84
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:45,519
They chatted for quite a while.

85
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:48,119
Mr. Zhao is so handsome,

86
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,640
and not intimidating at all.

87
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,799
He was very pleasant to Wan.

88
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:53,120
So you two are that close?

89
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,439
Wan is a big shot now.

90
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,040
Seriously impressive.

91
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,120
Have you all forgotten?

92
00:04:58,639 --> 00:05:00,679
A while ago, when that Feng Shui master

93
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:02,319
breathed fire and did his ritual,

94
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:05,199
Rongxin's stock price
multiplied several times over.

95
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:06,439
That's right.

96
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:08,896
Our third daughter is coming
back from studying abroad this year.

97
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:11,199
I wonder if there are any
eligible young men for her.

98
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,040
Speaking of that,

99
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,280
do you have any good
recommendations, Big Sister?

100
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,520
You dropped this at my place.

101
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,999
Can I pick you up today?

102
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:20,199
You can bring it to me then.

103
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:23,519
The material is pretty average.

104
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:25,839
Next time,

105
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:27,119
I'll wear ruby ones.

106
00:05:27,199 --> 00:05:28,439
Wan,

107
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:30,520
you really are a busy man these days.

108
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,839
You're practically glued to your phone.

109
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,600
Not at all.

110
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:38,759
If you can get on board with Zhao Shengge,

111
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:41,559
you'll be set for the rest of your life.

112
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,639
Exactly.

113
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:45,639
Wan,

114
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,160
come to my study.

115
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,000
Sweetheart,

116
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:55,080
don't make your father angry.

117
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:55,520
Okay.

118
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,600
I'm going.

119
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,000
Mom,

120
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,880
this tea of yours is pretty good.

121
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:10,759
You haven't been visiting
your mother much lately.

122
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,840
I've been busy.

123
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,920
No time.

124
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:19,639
Qingmiao is a restless soul.

125
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,199
Loves to gamble,

126
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,439
loves to have fun.

127
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:25,080
If it weren't for me all these years,

128
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,040
she wouldn't be living
such a comfortable life.

129
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,360
What do you want me to do for you?

130
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:33,720
What do you mean,

131
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:36,040
what do I want you to do?

132
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,280
You should be asking yourself

133
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:39,199
what you can do for this family.

134
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,080
Chen Wan,

135
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,560
I raised you for over twenty years,

136
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,919
and this is the attitude you give me?

137
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:48,359
You're giving me way too much credit.

138
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:50,119
You believe whatever outsiders say.

139
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:53,119
Not only does Zhuo Zhixuan
hold no power in his family,

140
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:54,776
even the Zhuo family as a whole right now

141
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,160
barely has any sway with Zhao Shengge.

142
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,040
Looking at you,

143
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:03,016
I never expected you to have any
deep connections with him anyway.

144
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:03,640
Tell you what.

145
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:05,760
That project of Zhao
Shengge's you're working on...

146
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,855
The two building materials
sectors are a perfect match

147
00:07:07,879 --> 00:07:10,199
for the new subsidiary your
eldest brother just took over.

148
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,679
Let's keep the good stuff in the family.

149
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:15,400
Do you know who Zhao Shengge is?

150
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,759
And who am I

151
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,439
to meddle in his business?

152
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:19,920
I have no say in it.

153
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,096
You think you're ready to
spread your wings and fly?

154
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,175
Your mother is still right here.

155
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:27,519
How far do you think you can get?

156
00:07:27,839 --> 00:07:29,839
She's been with me since
before she turned twenty.

157
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,415
I have every single thing she's ever
done right in the palm of my hand.

158
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,759
If you really care about her,

159
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,976
stop defying me and quit playing

160
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,119
your two-faced games with me.

161
00:07:38,199 --> 00:07:41,520
If what happened with you two
when you were a kid gets out,

162
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:44,040
forget about Zhao Shengge
ever working with you again.

163
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,120
Even in Haishi,

164
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,880
there won't be a place
for either of you to survive.

165
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:49,080
Fine.

166
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,480
Then I want shares.

167
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,800
You gave shares to all the
other branches of the family.

168
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,720
If you want me to do your bidding,

169
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,319
you have to make it worth my while.

170
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:01,439
You're asking for way too much.

171
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:03,160
If you give me nothing,

172
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,600
how am I supposed to work for you?

173
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:05,920
Fine.

174
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,400
I can give you two percent for now.

175
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,559
The rest depends on how you perform.

176
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:11,896
But let me warn you, don't even
think about playing tricks on me.

177
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:14,080
I invented those little
schemes you're trying to pull.

178
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,600
No matter how much you hate me,

179
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:18,839
we're still family at the end of the day.

180
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,720
As long as you're in Haishi,

181
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,096
you'll never shake off the Chen name.

182
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,480
When will you transfer the shares?

183
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:29,600
You're just like your mother.

184
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,199
Completely obsessed with money.

185
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,079
When?

186
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:33,439
You...

187
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:35,320
Payment upfront, then the work gets done.

188
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:38,840
Surely you know how this works, Mr. Chen.

189
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,720
Ungrateful wretch!

190
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,296
If what happened with you two
when you were a kid gets out,

191
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,839
forget about Zhao Shengge
ever working with you again.

192
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:15,079
Even in Haishi,

193
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:17,239
there won't be a place
for either of you to survive.

194
00:10:07,759 --> 00:10:08,759
It's fixed.

195
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,279
Wasn't too hard.

196
00:10:17,365 --> 00:10:19,578
[I'm coming to pick you up now]

197
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:23,480
I won't be joining you for dinner today.

198
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,720
I have plans.

199
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,000
How mysterious.

200
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,599
Nothing mysterious about it.

201
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:30,999
Still getting to know each other.

202
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,520
You don't just need to know him.

203
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,479
You need to know his family,

204
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:36,799
or rather, their family assets.

205
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:38,920
The Chen family is in decline,

206
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,520
and Chen Bingxin refuses to step down.

207
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:42,279
More importantly,

208
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,080
there's a big storm
brewing in the Chen family.

209
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:46,479
You need to brace yourself.

210
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,719
Even if I do nothing,

211
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:49,079
you only know part of the story.

212
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:52,080
Still, I had someone
tip him off anonymously.

213
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:53,840
He should know by now.

214
00:10:55,039 --> 00:10:56,240
You want to see

215
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,320
what he'll do?

216
00:10:58,799 --> 00:10:59,799
I want to help him.

217
00:11:25,919 --> 00:11:27,319
Aren't you leaving them in the car?

218
00:11:27,799 --> 00:11:29,519
Flowers are meant to be seen.

219
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,080
Okay.

220
00:11:32,799 --> 00:11:34,280
Why did you get me flowers again?

221
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,079
Because I'm still pursuing you.

222
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:38,559
I'm afraid you'll forget
me when we're apart.

223
00:11:40,279 --> 00:11:41,959
So you do realize that.

224
00:11:42,039 --> 00:11:43,360
Back in school,

225
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:45,960
when the guys in my class took
their girlfriends out on dates,

226
00:11:46,559 --> 00:11:48,640
they'd always buy them flowers first,

227
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,719
and then take them out to dinner.

228
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:52,439
So where are you taking me to eat?

229
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:54,759
I booked a place with great reviews.

230
00:11:55,639 --> 00:11:56,696
Thought I'd take you to try it.

231
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,720
Sounds good.

232
00:11:59,159 --> 00:11:59,839
Thank you.

233
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:01,976
Here is your sizzling octopus
with button mushrooms. Enjoy.

234
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,079
Thanks.

235
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:03,920
Sir,

236
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,440
your pan-seared sea
bass with scallops. Enjoy.

237
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:10,199
This is their signature sea bass.

238
00:12:10,279 --> 00:12:11,400
I pre-ordered it.

239
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,400
Try it.

240
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,679
Chen Wan,

241
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,216
have you been getting any rest at all?

242
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,839
Your dark circles are so heavy.

243
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:18,120
Are they?

244
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,439
Maybe a little bit.

245
00:12:19,512 --> 00:12:20,393
Alright.

246
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:23,240
I have to work hard and
make money to woo you.

247
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,360
Chen Wan,

248
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,320
you don't need to spend
a fortune to pursue me.

249
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,600
Yes, I do.

250
00:12:27,639 --> 00:12:28,679
It takes a lot of money.

251
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:30,400
Zhao Shengge,

252
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:33,840
when I say I'm pursuing
you, it's not just empty talk.

253
00:12:36,039 --> 00:12:38,400
I know you have everything
and want for nothing,

254
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,520
but I still want to give you the very best.

255
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,840
It's what I should do.

256
00:12:42,879 --> 00:12:43,879
Chen Wan.

257
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:47,360
It's okay if you don't like
it or need it, Zhao Shengge.

258
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:50,640
I'll do everything in my
power to treat you right.

259
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,799
I have to.

260
00:12:53,679 --> 00:12:55,056
The mistake I made
that time you were sick...

261
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,440
I'll never make it again.

262
00:12:58,919 --> 00:13:01,720
I've been wanting to
apologize to you for that.

263
00:13:03,519 --> 00:13:05,759
I didn't bring you
medicine back then because.

264
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,840
I was worried it would bother you.

265
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,880
But after we hung up,

266
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,480
I couldn't sleep all night.

267
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,479
I was worried you had a fever,

268
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:15,079
and that you didn't have any medicine.

269
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,600
It won't happen again.

270
00:13:17,159 --> 00:13:18,279
And I'm not saying this just

271
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:21,440
to get you to say yes to me.

272
00:13:22,879 --> 00:13:23,959
But I...

273
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:25,559
I forgave you a long time ago.

274
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,120
That day at the bowling alley,

275
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,919
you barely spoke to me.

276
00:13:30,679 --> 00:13:32,240
I was so worried you hated me.

277
00:13:34,679 --> 00:13:36,255
Is it because I bowled that
Christmas tree split for you?

278
00:13:36,279 --> 00:13:37,359
Is that why you forgave me?

279
00:13:37,399 --> 00:13:38,640
What do you think?

280
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:39,799
I guess so.

281
00:13:43,039 --> 00:13:44,039
Then, Zhao Shengge,

282
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,760
from now on,

283
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:48,319
if I ever mess up and make you mad again,

284
00:13:48,399 --> 00:13:50,040
I'll bowl another Christmas tree for you.

285
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,959
And once I do, you
have to forgive me, deal?

286
00:13:52,039 --> 00:13:54,360
So you're saying there will be a next time?

287
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,840
I'm just saying "if"!

288
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,079
Besides,

289
00:13:58,159 --> 00:14:00,160
even if you don't forgive me,

290
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,240
I'd still do it for you.

291
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:02,879
After all,

292
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:04,679
I just want you to be happy.

293
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:06,960
Chen Wan,

294
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,600
why?

295
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:11,119
What do you even like about me?

296
00:14:12,919 --> 00:14:14,760
How could anyone not
like you, Zhao Shengge?

297
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,400
Rationally speaking,

298
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,960
you should take me off this pedestal.

299
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,720
Pedestal?

300
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:24,880
We've spent quite some time together now.

301
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,199
By now, you must have realized

302
00:14:27,279 --> 00:14:28,719
that if you strip away the status,

303
00:14:28,799 --> 00:14:30,000
the prestige,

304
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,080
and the reputation,

305
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,400
I'm just an ordinary guy.

306
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,839
If my last name weren't Zhao,

307
00:14:34,919 --> 00:14:35,799
who knows?

308
00:14:35,879 --> 00:14:37,855
I might just be some young
guy working a nine-to-five,

309
00:14:37,879 --> 00:14:39,439
rushing to catch the subway every day.

310
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:40,640
Or maybe

311
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,096
an office worker stressed out of his mind

312
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,799
over car payments and a mortgage.

313
00:14:45,919 --> 00:14:47,255
Nothing wrong with taking the subway.

314
00:14:47,279 --> 00:14:49,079
If you were squeezing onto the subway,

315
00:14:49,159 --> 00:14:50,720
then that's where we would've met.

316
00:14:52,919 --> 00:14:53,919
Zhao Shengge,

317
00:14:54,519 --> 00:14:56,679
even on a crowded subway,
you'd never be ordinary.

318
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,320
Let's go take a look.

319
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,840
Sure.

320
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,440
Wait here a second.

321
00:15:51,399 --> 00:15:51,959
See which one you'd like to eat.

322
00:15:52,039 --> 00:15:52,319
Hello.

323
00:15:52,399 --> 00:15:53,559
Everything here is delicious.

324
00:15:57,279 --> 00:15:58,296
Brought a new friend, huh?

325
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,519
Want to request a song?

326
00:16:01,799 --> 00:16:03,456
Take care! Come back again if you like it!

327
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:05,679
I'll take this one, and this one, please.

328
00:17:03,519 --> 00:17:05,720
Once the Lai Chi Wun proposal wraps up,

329
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:07,960
we'll be ready to kick off the roadshow.

330
00:17:08,799 --> 00:17:09,560
As for sponsors,

331
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,720
do you have anyone in mind?

332
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:12,199
The Tan family,

333
00:17:12,279 --> 00:17:12,959
the Yao family,

334
00:17:13,039 --> 00:17:14,039
and Taiji

335
00:17:14,079 --> 00:17:15,759
have all expressed interest in partnering.

336
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,199
However, the Tans

337
00:17:17,279 --> 00:17:19,599
already have close
business ties with Minglong,

338
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,560
so it might not generate much added value.

339
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:24,279
If you ask me,

340
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:25,959
the Yao family is probably the best bet.

341
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,800
I'm serious.

342
00:17:29,879 --> 00:17:32,198
The one Xu Zhiying recommended to me is...

343
00:17:32,279 --> 00:17:33,120
Taiji.

344
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,560
They've shown a lot of sincerity.

345
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,040
Taiji is backed by foreign capital.

346
00:17:36,119 --> 00:17:37,119
That has its pros

347
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,479
and cons.

348
00:17:38,559 --> 00:17:39,679
Last quarter,

349
00:17:39,759 --> 00:17:41,439
they launched quite a few projects.

350
00:17:41,519 --> 00:17:42,679
And last year,

351
00:17:42,759 --> 00:17:45,279
they acquired a number of small
and medium-sized enterprises.

352
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,936
We should be cautious
about bringing them on board.

353
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:47,640
Still,

354
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,160
that's just my personal opinion.

355
00:17:49,759 --> 00:17:52,239
It ultimately depends on
what your risk assessment team thinks.

356
00:17:52,845 --> 00:17:53,925
You really know your stuff.

357
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,680
I saw their filings when they went public.

358
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,719
I'll take your input into consideration.

359
00:17:59,799 --> 00:18:02,199
The latest survey maps are in the folder.

360
00:18:02,279 --> 00:18:03,279
You can take a look.

361
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:10,160
CNOOC Tunnel No. 7.

362
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:13,519
This undersea tunnel doesn't
have an official name yet.

363
00:18:13,599 --> 00:18:14,599
Do you have any ideas?

364
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,679
The middle section of this tunnel

365
00:18:16,759 --> 00:18:19,519
spans a trench in the
world's largest ocean.

366
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,920
The gravitational pull is strong there,

367
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,400
and the tides are heavily
influenced by the moon.

368
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,480
In that spot,

369
00:18:26,559 --> 00:18:28,920
you can see a golden supermoon more often

370
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,359
than anywhere else in the world.

371
00:18:32,039 --> 00:18:33,640
I'd like to name it.

372
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:38,480
Full Moon Channel.

373
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:42,360
It has a wonderful meaning behind it.

374
00:19:15,519 --> 00:19:17,039
Who knows how long we'll have to wait?

375
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,960
Just wait it out.

376
00:19:35,759 --> 00:19:36,759
You're awake.

377
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:40,279
We still have time.

378
00:19:40,359 --> 00:19:41,359
No need to rush.

379
00:19:42,839 --> 00:19:43,839
Here.

380
00:19:44,359 --> 00:19:45,959
Zhao Shengge, you don't have to do that.

381
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,480
Let me.

382
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,480
This...

383
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,880
is for my eyes only.

384
00:20:23,119 --> 00:20:24,360
We're late!

385
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,440
Let's go.

386
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:28,456
Mr. Zhao, regarding the
area around Lai Chi Wun,

387
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:29,759
are there any other plans?

388
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,920
For the specific projects,

389
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,176
we'll have to wait for the
official documents to be released.

390
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:34,959
Right.

391
00:20:35,039 --> 00:20:35,880
I think

392
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:38,199
this area is going to
see a lot of foot traffic.

393
00:20:38,279 --> 00:20:40,840
So what are the future
plans for Lai Chi Wun?

394
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,920
In the future,

395
00:20:44,319 --> 00:20:44,920
I believe...

396
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:46,416
Thank goodness hardly anyone is here yet.

397
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:48,039
In the future, Lai Chi Wun

398
00:20:48,119 --> 00:20:50,480
can be transformed into a
slow-living space for Macau,

399
00:20:51,759 --> 00:20:52,936
providing both locals and tourists

400
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,720
with a high-quality cultural venue.

401
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:01,440
Chen Wan.

402
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:03,519
Do you know where my watch is?

403
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:05,775
Why is he asking him where his watch is?

404
00:21:05,799 --> 00:21:07,159
What's going on between those two?

405
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,959
Maybe you left it in the car just now.

406
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:14,560
Give me a second, I'll go look for it.

407
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,640
Okay.

408
00:21:30,960 --> 00:21:32,039
Zhao Shengge.

409
00:21:32,119 --> 00:21:33,199
Chen Wan.

410
00:21:33,279 --> 00:21:34,600
What am I to you?

411
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,280
You are the most important person to me.

412
00:21:36,319 --> 00:21:37,239
How important?

413
00:21:37,319 --> 00:21:38,640
Enough to tell me anything?

414
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,320
What are you thinking about right now?

415
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:41,519
Tell me.

416
00:21:41,599 --> 00:21:42,599
I want...

417
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:44,719
What else do you want?

418
00:21:44,799 --> 00:21:45,799
I want you.

419
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:03,680
Whatever you want,

420
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,279
I'll give it to you.

421
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,400
Zhao Shengge.

422
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:08,480
Does it feel good?

423
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,599
I can...

424
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:13,279
lift it a little higher.

425
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:24,759
Got it.

426
00:22:24,839 --> 00:22:25,839
I'm on my way.

427
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:36,560
It's so late.

428
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:37,640
Where are you going?

429
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:42,239
Work came up.

430
00:22:42,319 --> 00:22:43,759
Be safe out there.

431
00:22:43,839 --> 00:22:45,560
Watch out for the paparazzi downstairs.

432
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,720
Want me to give you a ride?

433
00:22:50,599 --> 00:22:51,599
Chen Wan.

434
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:53,920
Can you even stand up right now?

435
00:22:58,319 --> 00:22:59,319
Chen Wan.

436
00:23:00,359 --> 00:23:02,079
Are you trying to keep us a secret?
